sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor S as Studente
    participant Browser
    participant CF as Cloudflare
    participant Nginx as nginx
    participant App as TheBitLab app
    participant Google as Google OAuth / OIDC

    S->>Browser: apre https://app.thebitpoets.com/login
    Browser->>CF: GET /login
    CF->>Nginx: TLS origine
    Nginx->>App: GET /login
    App-->>Nginx: 200 pagina login
    Nginx-->>CF: 200
    CF-->>Browser: 200 pagina login

    S->>Browser: clicca "Accedi con Google"
    Browser->>CF: GET /auth/google/login
    CF->>Nginx: TLS origine
    Nginx->>App: GET /auth/google/login
    App->>App: genera state + nonce (sessione cookie)
    App-->>Nginx: 302 Location: accounts.google.com/...
    Nginx-->>CF: 302
    CF-->>Browser: 302 Location: accounts.google.com/...

    Browser->>Google: GET /o/oauth2/v2/auth
    S->>Google: autenticazione + consenso
    Google-->>Browser: 302 Location: https://app.thebitpoets.com/auth/google/callback?code=...&state=...

    Browser->>CF: GET /auth/google/callback
    CF->>Nginx: TLS origine
    Nginx->>App: GET /auth/google/callback
    App->>App: verifica state dalla query
    App->>Google: POST https://oauth2.googleapis.com/token (code → token)
    Google-->>App: token + id_token JWT
    App->>App: verifica firma JWT, nonce e estrae sub + email
    App->>App: crea/aggiorna utente ruolo pending
    App->>App: set cookie sessione HTTPOnly Secure SameSite
    App-->>Nginx: 303 /auth/account
    Nginx-->>CF: 303
    CF-->>Browser: 303 /auth/account

    Browser->>CF: GET /auth/account
    CF->>Nginx: TLS origine
    Nginx->>App: GET /auth/account
    App-->>Nginx: 200 "Account in attesa"
    Nginx-->>CF: 200
    CF-->>Browser: 200 "Account in attesa"

    Note over App,Browser: Admin approva utente via /auth/admin

    Browser->>CF: GET /auth/account
    CF->>Nginx: TLS origine
    Nginx->>App: GET /auth/account
    App-->>Nginx: 200 dashboard personale
    Nginx-->>CF: 200
    CF-->>Browser: 200 dashboard personale
